#: xfburn/xfburn-transcoder-basic.c:126
msgid ""
"The basic transcoder is built in,\n"
"and does not require any library.\n"
"But it can only handle uncompressed\n"
".wav files.\n"
"If you would like to create audio\n"
"compositions from different types of\n"
"audio files, please compile with\n"
"gstreamer support."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແປງລະຫັດພື້ນຖານຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງມາພ້ອມແລ້ວ,\n"
"ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄລບຣາຣີເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"
"ແຕ່ມັນຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ .wav\n"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ບີບອັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການເພງຈາກໄຟລ໌ສຽງ\n"
"ປະເພດອື່ນໆ, ກະລຸນາຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍການ\n"
"ຮອງຮັບ gstreamer."

#: xfburn/xfburn-transcoder-basic.c:150
#, c-format
msgid "File %s does not have a .wav extension"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ %s ບໍ່ມີນາມສະກຸນ .wav"

#: xfburn/xfburn-transcoder-basic.c:155
#, c-format
msgid "File %s does not contain uncompressed PCM wave audio"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ %s ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນສຽງ PCM wave ແບບບໍ່ບີບອັດ"

